 "steps": [
  {
   "caption": "f = Σm(0, 1, 2, 3, 5, 7, 8, 10, 14). A prime implicant is a loop that cannot be made any bigger. Grow a loop from every 1 in every direction it can go.",
   "patches": [
    {
     "id": "n0",
     "set": {
      "text": "9 ones; find every maximal loop",
      "tone": "muted"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "caption": "Starting from m0: the whole top row is 1s, a quad A′B′. It cannot grow (row A B = 01 is not all 1s).",
   "patches": [
    {
     "id": "P00",
     "set": {
      "hidden": false
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "n0",
     "set": {
      "text": "PI 1: A′B′ (m0 1 2 3)",
      "tone": "accent"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "caption": "Starting from m5: m1, m3, m5, m7 form a quad A′D (rows 00 and 01, columns 01 and 11).",
   "patches": [
    {
     "id": "P10",
     "set": {
      "hidden": false
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "n1",
     "set": {
      "text": "PI 2: A′D (m1 3 5 7)",
      "tone": "success"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "caption": "Starting from m8: m0, m2, m8, m10 are the four corners, a quad B′D′.",
   "patches": [
    {
     "id": "P20",
     "set": {
      "hidden": false
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "P21",
     "set": {
      "hidden": false
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "P22",
     "set": {
      "hidden": false
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "P23",
     "set": {
      "hidden": false
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "n2",
     "set": {
      "text": "PI 3: B′D′ (m0 2 8 10)",
      "tone": "info"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "caption": "Starting from m14: its only neighbouring 1 is m10, so the largest loop is the pair ACD′. No 1 is left outside a loop: there are exactly 4 prime implicants.",
   "patches": [
    {
     "id": "P30",
     "set": {
      "hidden": false
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "n3",
     "set": {
      "text": "PI 4: ACD′ (m10 14)",
      "tone": "warning"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "caption": "The biggest loop is not always needed: A′B′'s cells 0, 2 are inside B′D′ and 1, 3 inside A′D. It is a prime implicant but a redundant one. Minimal SOP: f = A′D + B′D′ + ACD′.",
   "patches": [
    {
     "id": "P00",
     "set": {
      "hidden": true
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "n0",
     "set": {
      "text": "PI 1: A′B′ is redundant",
      "tone": "danger"
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "ex",
     "set": {
      "text": "f = A′D + B′D′ + ACD′",
      "tone": "success"
     }
    }
   ]
